 expert ratings, or fundraising figures exist for this race, so the forecast rests on Idaho's underlying partisanship.\n\nBecause the incumbent president is term-limited, neither party benefits from incumbency, and the national political environment could shift margins in either direction. Even so, a swing large enough to put Idaho in doubt would need to far exceed anything seen in modern presidential politics. The Republican nominee is strongly favored, and the main question is the size of the margin rather than the winner.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.0246, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.0539, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.0537, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.0553, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.0476, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.0546, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.0466, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.0509, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.049, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.0539, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.0538, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.0585, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.0558, "margin": -17.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.0571, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.0506, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.0387, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.0587, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.054, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-11", "p_dem": 0.0485, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-12", "p_dem": 0.0583, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-13", "p_dem": 0.0435, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-14", "p_dem": 0.0541, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-15", "p_dem": 0.0549, "margin": -18.0}, {"date": "2026-10-16", "p_dem": 0.0581, "margin": -17.0}, {"date": "2026-10-17", "p_dem": 0.055, "margin": -18.0}, {"date":